e,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-202","type":"paragraph","en":".ms--1"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-203","type":"paragraph","en":"margin-inline-start: -0.25rem;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-204","type":"paragraph","en":".ms--2"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-205","type":"paragraph","en":"margin-inline-start: -0.5rem;"}]}]},{"head":false,"cells":[{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-206","type":"paragraph","en":".ms-auto"}]},{"type":"td","body":[{"id":"content--paragraph-207","type":"paragraph","en":"margin-inline-start: auto;"}]}]}]},{"id":"overview","type":"heading","en":"Overview","level":2},{"id":"overview--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use margin utilities to control the outer space around elements. Margin utilities are built from a default Sass map ranging from <code>0</code> to <code>3rem</code> (<code>.m-0</code> through <code>.m-12</code>). Use utilities like <code>.m-3</code> and <code>.m-5</code> to control the margin on all sides of an element:"},{"id":"overview--example-1","type":"demo","key":"0dbc1b75590c99ec125d","height":174},{"id":"overview--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"m-3\">.m-3</div>\n<div class=\"m-5\">.m-5</div>","language":""},{"id":"overview--note-1","type":"note","tone":"info","body":[{"id":"overview--note-text-1","type":"note-text","en":"<strong>Using flexbox or CSS Grid?</strong> Consider using <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/gap\">the gap utility</a> instead."}]},{"id":"notation","type":"heading","en":"Notation","level":2},{"id":"notation--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Margin utilities that apply to all breakpoints, from <code>xs</code> to <code>2xl</code>, have no breakpoint prefix in them. This is because those classes are applied from <code>min-width: 0</code> and up, and thus are not bound by a media query. The remaining breakpoints, however, do include a breakpoint prefix."},{"id":"notation--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The classes are named using the format <code>{property}{sides}-{size}</code> for <code>xs</code> and <code>{breakpoint}:{property}{sides}-{size}</code> for <code>sm</code>, <code>md</code>, <code>lg</code>, <code>xl</code>, and <code>2xl</code>."},{"id":"notation--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Where <em>property</em> is:"},{"id":"notation--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>m</code> - for classes that set <code>margin</code>"}]}]},{"id":"notation--paragraph-4","type":"paragraph","en":"Where <em>sides</em> is one of:"},{"id":"notation--list-2","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>t</code> - for classes that set <code>margin-top</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>b</code> - for classes that set <code>margin-bottom</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>s</code> - (start) for classes that set <code>margin-left</code> in LTR, <code>margin-right</code> in RTL"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>e</code> - (end) for classes that set <code>margin-right</code> in LTR, <code>margin-left</code> in RTL"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-6","type":"item","en":"<code>x</code> - for classes that set both <code>*-left</code> and <code>*-right</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-7","type":"item","en":"<code>y</code> - for classes that set both <code>*-top</code> and <code>*-bottom</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-8","type":"item","en":"blank - for classes that set a <code>margin</code> on all 4 sides of the element"}]}]},{"id":"notation--paragraph-5","type":"paragraph","en":"Where <em>size</em> is one of:"},{"id":"notation--list-3","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-9","type":"item","en":"<code>0</code> - for classes that eliminate the <code>margin</code> by setting it to <code>0</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-10","type":"item","en":"<code>1</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * .25</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-11","type":"item","en":"<code>2</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * .375</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-12","type":"item","en":"<code>3</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * .5</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-13","type":"item","en":"<code>4</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * .75</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-14","type":"item","en":"<code>5</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 1</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-15","type":"item","en":"<code>6</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 1.25</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-16","type":"item","en":"<code>7</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 1.5</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-17","type":"item","en":"<code>8</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 1.75</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-18","type":"item","en":"<code>9</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 2</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-19","type":"item","en":"<code>10</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 2.25</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-20","type":"item","en":"<code>11</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 2.5</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-21","type":"item","en":"<code>12</code> - (by default) for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to <code>$spacer * 3</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"notation--item-22","type":"item","en":"<code>auto</code> - for classes that set the <code>margin</code> to auto"}]}]},{"id":"notation--paragraph-6","type":"paragraph","en":"(You can add more sizes by adding entries to the <code>$spacers</code> Sass map variable.)"},{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"single-side","type":"heading","en":"Single side","level":3},{"id":"single-side--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use utilities like <code>.mt-3</code>, <code>.me-2</code>, <code>.mb-4</code>, and <code>.ms-1</code> to control the margin on one side of an element:"},{"id":"single-side--example-1","type":"demo","key":"6f6ccd83a44035ac0bf8","height":228},{"id":"single-side--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mt-4\">.mt-4</div>\n<div class=\"me-4\">.me-4</div>\n<div class=\"mb-4\">.mb-4</div>\n<div class=\"ms-4\">.ms-4</div>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal-margin","type":"heading","en":"Horizontal margin","level":3},{"id":"horizontal-margin--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use utilities like <code>.mx-3</code> and <code>.mx-5</code> to control the horizontal margin of an element:"},{"id":"horizontal-margin--example-1","type":"demo","key":"40a956878851ca0cd1c1","height":174},{"id":"horizontal-margin--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mx-3\">.mx-3</div>\n<div class=\"mx-5\">.mx-5</div>","language":""},{"id":"vertical-margin","type":"heading","en":"Vertical margin","level":3},{"id":"vertical-margin--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Use utilities like <code>.my-3</code> and <code>.my-5</code> to control the vertical margin of an element:"},{"id":"vertical-margin--example-1","type":"demo","key":"4d90fe8ca93f81aaab33","height":174},{"id":"vertical-margin--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"my-3\">.my-3</div>\n<div class=\"my-5\">.my-5</div>","language":""},{"id":"horizontal-centering","type":"heading","en":"Horizontal centering","level":3},{"id":"horizontal-centering--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap includes an <code>.mx-auto</code> class for horizontally centering fixed-width block level content—that is, content that has <code>display: block</code> and a <code>width</code> set—by setting the horizontal margins to <code>auto</code>."},{"id":"horizontal-centering--example-1","type":"demo","key":"cf1628e994715bd68359","height":147},{"id":"horizontal-centering--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"mx-auto\" style=\"width: 200px;\">\n  Centered element\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"negative-margin","type":"heading","en":"Negative margin","level":2},{"id":"negative-margin--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"In CSS, <code>margin</code> properties can utilize negative values (<code>padding</code> cannot). In v6, negative margins are limited to <code>margin-inline-start</code> and <code>margin-inline-end</code> only, using spacers <code>-1</code> (<code>-0.25rem</code>) and <code>-2</code> (<code>-0.5rem</code>):"},{"id":"negative-margin--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div class=\"ms--1\">.ms--1</div>\n<div class=\"me--2\">.me--2</div>","language":""},{"id":"negative-margin--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"The v5 full negative margin utilities across all sides (like <code>.mt-n1</code>) have been removed."},{"id":"responsive","type":"heading","en":"Responsive","level":2},{"id":"responsive--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"All margin utilities are responsive and include all breakpoints."},{"id":"responsive--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>.m-0</code> through <code>.m-12</code> and <code>.m-auto</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>.sm:m-0</code> through <code>.sm:m-12</code> and <code>.sm:m-auto</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-3","type":"item","en":"<code>.md:m-0</code> through <code>.md:m-12</code> and <code>.md:m-auto</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-4","type":"item","en":"<code>.lg:m-0</code> through <code>.lg:m-12</code> and <code>.lg:m-auto</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-5","type":"item","en":"<code>.xl:m-0</code> through <code>.xl:m-12</code> and <code>.xl:m-auto</code>"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"responsive--item-6","type":"item","en":"<code>.2xl:m-0</code> through <code>.2xl:m-12</code> and <code>.2xl:m-auto</code>"}]}]},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"sass-utilities-api","type":"heading","en":"Sass utilities API","level":3},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Margin utilities are declared in our utilities API in <code>scss/_utilities.scss</code>. <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/utilities/api#using-the-api\">Learn how to use the utilities API.</a>"},{"id":"sass-utilities-api--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"margin\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin,\n  class: m,\n  values: map.merge($spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-x\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-inline,\n  class: mx,\n  values: map.merge($spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-y\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-block,\n  class: my,\n  values: map.merge($spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-top\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-block-start,\n  class: mt,\n  values: map.merge($spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-end\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-inline-end,\n  class: me,\n  values: map-merge-multiple($spacers, $negative-spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-bottom\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-block-end,\n  class: mb,\n  values: map.merge($spacers, (auto: auto))\n),\n\"margin-start\": (\n  responsive: true,\n  property: margin-inline-start,\n  class: ms,\n  values: map-merge-multiple($spacers, $negative-spacers, (auto: auto))\n),","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"0dbc1b75590c99ec125d","html":"\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 m-3 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .m-3\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 m-5 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .m-5\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-4 text-center"},"sprite":""},{"key":"6f6ccd83a44035ac0bf8","html":"\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 mt-4 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .mt-4\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 me-4 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .me-4\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 mb-4 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .mb-4\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 ms-4 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .ms-4\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center gap-4 text-center"},"sprite":""},{"key":"40a956878851ca0cd1c1","html":"\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 mx-3 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .mx-3\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 mx-5 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .mx-5\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex flex-column align-items-center justify-content-center gap-4 text-center"},"sprite":""},{"key":"4d90fe8ca93f81aaab33","html":"\n  <div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 my-3 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .my-3\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 d-inline-block\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 my-5 bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .my-5\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-4 text-center"},"sprite":""},{"key":"cf1628e994715bd68359","html":"\n<div class=\"bd-pattern-diagonal rounded-3 w-100\">\n  <div class=\"w-12 p-3 mx-auto bg-accent fg-contrast-accent rounded-3\">\n    .mx-auto\n  </div>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center text-center"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"Quickstart","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/quickstart"},{"en":"npm","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/npm"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/vite"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/contribute"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/migration"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","h